e2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"Both material outcomes are satisfied with direct final-state and behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement and observed disruption, a changed post-restart boot identity, and recovered service/configuration and synchronization. Independent lifecycle boot observations corroborate both identity changes.","limitations":[]}
